<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Register your business — EcoCycle</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/auth/register.css"></head>
<body class="auth-page"><header class="auth-header"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark"><img src="/images/figma/ecocycle-leaf.svg" alt=""></span><span>EcoCycle</span></a><a href="/">← Back to home</a></header>
<main class="auth-layout register-layout"><section class="auth-aside"><p class="eyebrow">JOIN THE CIRCULAR NETWORK</p><h1>Good for your<br>business. <em>Better<br>for what comes next.</em></h1><p>Connect with Malaysian businesses, make better use of materials, and find new value in your everyday operations.</p><div class="auth-aside-note"><span>✓</span> Create a business profile to get started.</div></section><section class="auth-card"><p class="eyebrow">BUSINESS SIGN UP</p><h2>Create your account</h2><p class="auth-subtitle">Start your EcoCycle business profile.</p><div class="preview-notice">This registration screen is a visual preview. Account creation will work once authentication is connected.</div><form onsubmit="event.preventDefault();document.getElementById('form-note').hidden=false"><label for="business-name">Business name</label><input id="business-name" name="business_name" type="text" placeholder="Your business name" autocomplete="organization" required><label for="contact-name">Your name</label><input id="contact-name" name="contact_name" type="text" placeholder="Full name" autocomplete="name" required><label for="register-email">Business email</label><input id="register-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@business.com" autocomplete="email" required><label for="new-password">Create password</label><input id="new-password" name="password" type="password" placeholder="At least 8 characters" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" required><button class="button button-dark auth-submit" type="submit">Create business account <span>→</span></button><p id="form-note" class="form-note" hidden>Registration is not connected yet. Your details were not submitted.</p></form><p class="auth-switch">Already registered? <a href="/login">Log in</a></p></section></main></body></html>
